 python/sglang/srt/environ.py                  |  7 ++-
 .../layers/attention/flashinfer_backend.py    | 41 ++++++++++++-
 .../layers/attention/flashinfer_hostgap.py    | 61 ++++++++++++++++---
 3 files changed, 93 insertions(+), 16 deletions(-)

